---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';import {articles} from '../lib/data';
const topics=[...new Set(articles.map(a=>a.topic))];
---
<Base title="Narrative analysis"><div class="page-heading"><span class="kicker">FRAMING & THEMES</span><h1>Narrative analysis</h1><p>Explore recurring topics in the checked file. Shared themes or nearby publication dates are descriptive observations, not evidence of coordination.</p></div><div class="section-head"><h2>Topics in the file</h2></div><div class="topic-grid">{topics.map(topic=>{const work=articles.filter(a=>a.topic===topic);return <section class="topic-card panel"><div><span class="kicker">{work.length} {work.length===1?'ARTICLE':'ARTICLES'}</span><h2>{topic}</h2></div><div class="topic-links">{work.map(a=><a href={`/articles/${a.id}/`}><span>{a.date} / {a.publication}</span><strong>{a.headline}</strong></a>)}</div></section>})}</div><div class="section-head"><h2>Analytical limits</h2></div><div class="empty panel"><strong>Similarity needs context</strong><p>The present sample is too small for reliable headline similarity, shared-source, or timing-cluster claims. Those analyses will appear only when enough verified records and attributed source data exist.</p></div></Base>
<style>.topic-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:15px}.topic-card{padding:25px}.topic-card h2{font:600 25px 'Playfair Display',serif;margin:11px 0 20px}.topic-links{display:grid}.topic-links a{padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid #2a3945}.topic-links a:hover strong{color:#ef827a}.topic-links span{display:block;font:10px 'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;color:#8c9cab;margin-bottom:6px}.topic-links strong{font:500 15px/1.4 'DM Sans',sans-serif}@media(max-width:700px){.topic-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
